==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*10 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

